[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4346040290","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119093#issuecomment-4346040290","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119093","id":4346040290,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAwtP4g","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-29T17:32:18Z","updated_at":"2026-04-29T17:32:18Z","body":"This, to me, is a whole new feature added to the `Image` class -- and one that I've wanted for a while! Thanks! It's good that it updates the internal editor screenshot functionality, but I think it would be great to consider adding this as a new feature of the `Image` class in 4.8. #119013 can still be merged as the basic bugfix for 4.7.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4346040290/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4353775125","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119093#issuecomment-4353775125","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119093","id":4353775125,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABA4FWFQ","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-30T15:24:25Z","updated_at":"2026-04-30T17:53:56Z","body":"Haven't tested this yet, but sometime before this is ready for review, docs will need to be updated in at least these three spots:\r\n\r\n1. https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_image.html#class-image-method-srgb-to-linear\r\n2. https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_image.html#class-image-method-linear-to-srgb\r\n3. https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_viewporttexture.html#description\r\n   - The order of the two lines in the example script needs to be changed, just like the changes made to editor_node\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4353775125/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confus