d<ImageFormatLoader::LoaderFlags> p_flags, float p_scale)`\r\n3. [scene_debugger.cpp](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/a0375dde960ee9dba46d461e0145123609691950/scene/debugger/scene_debugger.cpp#L557): `SceneDebugger::_msg_rq_screenshot(const Array &p_args)`\r\n4. [movie_writer.cpp](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/a0375dde960ee9dba46d461e0145123609691950/servers/movie_writer/movie_writer.cpp#L236): `MovieWriter::add_frame()`","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4354118999/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4355931671","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119093#issuecomment-4355931671","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119093","id":4355931671,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABA6I-Fw","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-30T20:29:09Z","updated_at":"2026-04-30T20:29:09Z","body":"> Here is a list of other places that call these updated functions that might benefit from reworking in the same way as EditorNode:\r\n\r\nSeems like `1` and `2` does not work with any half-float formats, so won't be affected or need any changes, `3` is already changed to do convention to RGBA8 after linear-to-srgb, added the same for the `4`.\r\n\r\n> docs will need to be updated in at least these three spots\r\n\r\nUpdated.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4355931671/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4356007653","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119093#issuecomment-4356007653","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119093","id":4356007653,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABA6Nm5Q","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-30T20:41:46Z","updated_at":"2026-04-30T21:55:36Z","body":"For the reference current half-float code is about 10 times slower than RGBA8 lookup table code, it's still acceptable for screenshots (takes about 0.5 sec for 8K image in debug build), but likely is not OK for `MoveWriter`.\n\nEdit: if parallelized, it's slightly faster than RGBA8, but offloading it to GPU would likely be a better option.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4356007653/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4359400064","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119093#issuecomment-4359400064","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119093","id":4359400064,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABA9cqgA","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-01T13:05:51Z","updated_at":"2026-05-01T13:05:51Z","body":"It’s good to hear there are options for making movie maker faster. It should, like most parts of the engine, be as fast as possible.\r\n\r\nThat said, even if movie maker ends up being significantly slower when the window’s HDR 2D setting is enabled I think the improved visual quality is what most users would desire for this feature. My reasoning is:\r\n\r\n1. Users primarily use the movie maker feature for lossless and high quality frame-by-frame capture.\r\n2. When users are not concerned about visual quality, they use an external capture tool like OBS, which is very high performance at the cost of some visual quality.\r\n3. I believe movie maker can simply slow down game output while running to make sure no frames are dropped.\r\n\r\nIn short, if users want highest quality, they use the Movie Maker feature in Godot. If they want highest performance and do not need lossless quality, they use something like OBS instead.\r\n\r\nThat’s my guess, anyway…","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4359400064/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4364481640","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119093#issuecomment-4364481640","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119093","id":4364481640,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBCS0aA","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-02T18:43:11Z","updated_at":"2026-05-02T18:43:11Z","body":"Movie Maker is mostly about getting perfect frame pacing and using graphics settings not viable in real-time. You can get lossless quality from OBS, but it's way more likely to drop frames (even on a top-end system).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4364481640/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4537777105","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119093#issuecomment-4537777105","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119093","id":4537777105,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDnj70Q","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-25T22:50:35Z","updated_at":"2026-05-26T00:02:35Z","body":"Once merged, this PR will mostly fix #112934, so feel free to add that to the PR description text.\r\n\r\n(I still think that it would be nice if `Texture2D` had metadata about what sort of encoding and data it contains so the `save_` functions could handle encoding transformations automatically... but the bigger issue is resolved by this PR.)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4537777105/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5308454455","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119093#issuecomment-5308454455","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119093","id":5308454455,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABPGiWNw","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-16T16:29:57Z","updated_at":"2026-09-08T15:59:39Z","body":"I've been doing some more testing with this and I think the issue I described in [this comment](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119093#pullrequestreview-4284567746) might be a bit worse than I originally thought. Colours are always off by a bit and gradients in rendered textures are especially a problem where some sRGB values are skipped entirely. The following demonstrates the problem with a nearest-neighbour sampled texture, but it happens with a simple ColorRect as well (produces a colour that is off by 1 sRGB value).\r\n\r\nMRP: [half-float-srgb-conversion.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/31119836/half-float-srgb-conversion.zip)\r\n\r\nOS|Expected screenshot | EXR screenshot | PNG screenshot (this PR)\r\n--|--|--|--\r\nWindows|<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"windows_print_screen\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ae199ae6-20d0-4093-b09a-8d4149e9fcb6\" />| <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"screenshot exr\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1595019a-2510-4863-a3d3-4a2482dde6f9\" /> |<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"screenshot\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/63e1672c-d41d-472c-b2e1-f32a133f669f\" />\r\nmacOS | (same as above)| <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"screenshot exr\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/959096c9-368c-4d99-90a7-52ee174185fd\" />|<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"screenshot\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8316df0d-28df-4a1d-bb06-4d98faa1fa95\" />\r\n\r\nFor the above EXR screenshots, I used `Image.save_exr(\"screenshot.exr\", false, true)` and then used Adobe Photoshop to convert the EXR HDR image to an 8-bit SDR image.\r\n\r\nI want to dig into this more to get a better understanding of where the issue is coming from so we can better reason about how this should be fixed (in this PR or in a followup). My best guess is maybe `Image::convert` is problematic here??\r\n\r\n@bruvzg any thoughts on this?\r\n\r\nEdit: Seems that #112541 will fix this issue! I'll retest when this other PR has been merged into master.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5308454455/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5589701720","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119093#issuecomment-5589701720","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119093","id":5589701720,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABTSwUWA","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-08T18:10:44Z","updated_at":"2026-09-08T18:10:44Z","body":"The issue I mentioned in my [last 