":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-09T22:20:24Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T22:20:24Z","body":"I'm marking this as ready to merge, given the following:\r\n\r\n1. This PR solves [this problem](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112934): it is impossible to use scripts to save a screenshot of a `Viewport` that uses HDR 2D.\r\n2. I have tested this a fair bit and cannot find any issues.\r\n3. Although I am not a core member who can verify `WorkerThreadPool` usage, I trust bruvg to know how to use this correctly and its usage appears consistent with other existing uses.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5609530536/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5623352956","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119093#issuecomment-5623352956","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119093","id":5623352956,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABTy2OfA","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"htt